texts.CeruleanCity_Text_GruntIntro:
Hey! Stay out! It's not your yard!

…Huh? Me?

I'm an innocent bystander! Don't you believe me?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Daisy:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: DAISY To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}While I was comfortably enjoying my tea breaks, you've grown very skilled and powerful.

I hope you'll remain a good rival to my little brother.

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Brock:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BROCK To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}In this big world of ours, there must be many tough TRAINERS.

Let's both keep training and making ourselves stronger!

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Misty:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: MISTY To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I'm going to keep training here at this GYM.

When I get better, I'd love to hit the road and travel.

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Koga:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: KOGA To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}You and I, we must both set our sights higher and work towards meeting our challenges.

Now, I must go train my daughter.

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Sabrina:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: SABRINA To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The love you have towards your POKéMON…

It was a power that was never bested by my psychic power.

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Blaine:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BLAINE To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}My fire POKéMON! They'll become even more powerful!

And now, a quiz. How many kinds of FIRE-type POKéMON are there?

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Bruno:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: BRUNO To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}The super power of your POKéMON and you I've experienced myself.

Next time, maybe I should show you how to train yourself.

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Agatha:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: AGATHA To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}When you grow older, don't you dare go soft like that coot OAK!

Be like me and keep battling on!

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_MrFuji:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: MR. FUJI To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Instead of hoping for the happiness of just your POKéMON…

…Can I get you to wish for the happiness of all POKéMON?

texts.gFameCheckerPersonQuote_Giovanni:
{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: GIOVANNI To: {PLAYER}

{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}There is nothing that I wish to say to you.

I will concentrate solely on bettering myself, and none other.

